# Extra requirements of tenko-base that are not base package-set entries.
#
# - tenko-*: distro glue (filesystem layout, sysconfig, release file,
#   first-boot policy, RPM macros)
# - glibc-locales, gcc-lto: payload split out of the toolchain
# - linux-api-headers, linux-pam, libtirpc: headers/runtime the base needs
# - make-ca: CA trust store (/etc/pki/tls/certs/ca-bundle.crt and the
#   /etc/ssl/certs links) used by curl, git, OpenSSL and derived images
# - openssh, git: SSH client/server and version control in the base install
# - libseccomp/libbsd/libmd, rpm/popt/libarchive/lua: RPM toolchain
# - ncat, ncdu, htop, nodejs, bash-completion, podman-bin: user-requested
#   additions to the base install (base-packages-additions.md).
#   podman-bin provides the podman package name.
